AB  - Ultrasonography guidance can help make procedures safer and more effective, 
      particularly in the intensive care setting. This article discusses techniques to 
      optimize periprocedural ultrasonography and reviews common intensive care 
      procedures for which ultrasonography can be used: vascular access procedures, 
      paracentesis, thoracentesis, and pericardiocentesis.
