AB  - Isolated pleural effusion is a rare presentation of ovarian hyperstimulation 
      syndrome following ovulation induction therapy. We hereby report the case of a 
      24-year-old female who presented with unilateral moderate pleural effusion 
      following ovulation induction therapy. Therapeutic thoracentesis was performed to 
      relieve the breathlessness in this case.
