AB  - Ultrasound guidance has become the standard of care for many bedside procedures, 
      owing to its portability, ease of use, and significant reduction in 
      complications. This article serves as an introduction to the use of 
      ultrasonography in several advanced procedures, including pericardiocentesis, 
      thoracentesis, paracentesis, lumbar puncture, regional anesthesia, and 
      peritonsillar abscess drainage.
