TI  - [A thoracentesis needle with spring-loaded valve].
PG  - 389-90
AB  - With the new-style thoracentesis needles with spring-loaded valve designed by 
      ourselves, thoracentesis were carried out in 60 patients with ages ranging from 2 
      to 74 years. The successful rate for the operation was 100% (198/198), without 
      any major complications such as pneumothorax, hemothorax, pleural shock or 
      infection. The results show that this kind of puncture needle is multi-purpose 
      and easy to operate, with high safety and reliability.
