TI  - Subcutaneous and muscle layer seroma complicated with thoracentesis.
PG  - e01100
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.1100 [doi]
LID - e01100
AB  - Diagnostic thoracentesis is a basic and relatively safe diagnostic method for 
      patients with pleural effusion. However, complications of thoracentesis are rare 
      and not well known because of the low incidence. Herein, we report a case of 
      subcutaneous and muscle layer seroma following thoracentesis.
