TI  - Real-time ultrasound-guided thoracentesis.
PG  - 32-37
LID - 10.1097/01.JAA.0000508210.40675.09 [doi]
AB  - Clinicians commonly see patients with pleural effusions requiring thoracentesis. 
      The latest evidence-based guidelines for thoracentesis recommend real-time 
      ultrasound guidance for the safest outcomes from this procedure. This article 
      reviews real-time ultrasound guidance for thoracentesis to help referring 
      clinicians understand the technique and the guidelines for the performance of 
      thoracentesis.
