AB  - Thoracentesis is a procedure consisting in the insertion of a needle in the 
      pleural space. It is used to remove and analyse pleural fluid. Based on a review 
      of the literature, this article describes the indications, the contraindications, 
      the complications and the technique of this commonly performed procedure.
